Just ascended with a Valk, my first in NH3.1.1.

possible spoilers...


Found an lawful altar on level 2, converted it, sacrifice a jackle and
Odin rewarded me with Mjollnir.  Hacking through the gnomnish mine with
no problem.  Grab the luckstone, eating a stalker corpse made me
invisible, argh, can't go in shops anymore.

I stayed in the mines a little longer to stock up on wand of create
monsters.  Go back to level 2 and keep on zapping it, praying once
whenever I get "you feel you are thoroughly on the right path" message.
Got some pretty useful stuff, including Vorpal Blade, Magicbane,
Firebrand and 2 other useless artificts which I put them in a chest;
also got blessed spellbook of identify, remove curse, finger of death
polymorph and extra healing.  When I am sick and tired of this I
proceeded down.  By then I was level 13, went down all the way to Medusa
level still level 13.  But luckily on the way back a wraith put me over.
Now I think I am powerful enough to kick some shopkeeper's butt, so I
take out my wand of digging, just dig a hole in the shop walls and
refuse to pay.  In a quite large armor shop I found speed boots,
gauntlets of power and helm of opposite alignment.  I found a fountain
and made Excalibur.  The quest was pretty easy, Lord Suntur dosen't
taste great, but is good enough to satiste me.  Hacking all the way down
to the light shop in Gnome town, only 4 candles!  There was also a
hardware store but no candles.  So I have to polymorph those stuff into
3 candles which turned my spellbook of polymorph into blessed spellbook
of blank paper.  Breezed all the way down to castle, only got 3 wishes
out of my wand of wishing.  But luckily the throne gave me 2 wishes.  I
wished for GDSM, some scrolls of enchant weapon, ring of levitation
since I still haven't found one; blessed bag of holding and 3 blessed
scrolls of genocide, but got only 1.  So I decided to wipe out all
liches so there won't be so many "mumbling curse" messages.  Wand of
Death from Orcus was pretty useful killing the high priest and the
Wizard of Yendor.  The rest was pretty uneventful, except my bad of
holding became cursed and I couldn't do anything, so I had to drop it
and leave all my gold, food and holy waters along with other stuff
behind, this was in the water plane btw.  By the time I found the portal
to the Astral Planes I was weak, but fortunately the 1st thing I saw was
a yellow dragon named Eva, so I eat her(anything special about named
dragons?)  Without furthur delay I sacrificed the amulet.

Stuff I ascended with:
+4 Excalibur, +4 Mjollnir, +4 Vorpal Blade, +1 Magicbane.
+3 GDSM,+2 Gauntlets of Power,+3 speed boots, +4 shield of reflection,
ring of conflict, +2 cloak of displacement.

Some notes:

Excalibur IMHO is definitely the best weapon, it is good against all
monsters, protects you from level drain and gives searching which was
pretty useful in the elemental planes if you are looking for the portal.

How do you fireproof something?

Ring of conflict is also very powerful, almost too powerful.

What's the chance of a magic marker occur in the game?  I never did
found one despite empty about 50wand of create monsters.

What good is blessed spellbook of blank papers?  Can you write on them
with magic markers?

Is there anyway to uncurse the bag of holding I had?  I was stressed so
I couldn't take anything out of it.  And all my scrolls of remove curse
and holy potions are in there with the spellbook of remove curse and I
forgot the spell of remove curse.

And last, can you pray in the elemental planes?

Thanks for your answers.

Andy


